'''Unione Sportiva Cremonese''', commonly referred to as '''Cremonese''', is an Italian professional [[Association football|football]] [[List of football clubs in Italy|club]] based in [[Cremona]], [[Lombardy]], which plays in [[Serie B]], following their relegation from [[Serie A]] in the [[2025–26 Serie A|2025–26 season]]."}}
